   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "The 1 just means &quot;intercept.&quot;  If you want intercept constrained to 0, use 0*1.  When you use the growth function, a mean structure (including intercepts) is assumed, as it is in lm, lmer, and many other functions.<div>--Ed Rigdon</div>"
    ],
